    nyra "We grabbed you light portions. Well, not that light, actually. You've got rice, chicken and veggies. Nothing that'll turn your stomach, and everything you need to get your strength back."

# game/scenario/11_0_1_1.rpy:293
translate english noam_garde_secret_e7abb1ea:

    # kami "Quel choix intéressant, n’est-ce pas ?"
    kami "Quite an interesting choice, wouldn't you say?"

# game/scenario/11_0_1_1.rpy:297
translate english noam_garde_secret_1d515f3f:

    # think "Il cherche encore la photo de sa sœur ?"
    think "He's still looking for his sister's photo?"

# game/scenario/11_0_1_1.rpy:425
translate english noam_garde_secret_f457e62e:

    # noam "Alors je veux en avoir le cœur net."
    noam "So I want to know for sure."

# game/scenario/11_0_1_1.rpy:472
translate english noam_garde_secret_b528ea31:

    # kami "Que va en penser ta famille sinon ?!"
    kami "What would your family think otherwise?!"

# game/scenario/11_0_1_1.rpy:620
translate english noam_garde_secret_9248d9dc:

    # kami "Regarde-les dans les yeux et demande-toi : lequel d’entre eux est capable de faire... ça..."
    kami "Look them in the eye and ask yourself: which one of them is capable of doing... that..."

# game/scenario/11_0_1_1.rpy:727
translate english noam_garde_secret_1c40eeac:

    # think "Mais le sommeil ne vient pas. Seulement un tourbillon de visages, de soupçons, et cette silhouette qui... Non."
    think "But sleep doesn't come. Just a whirl of faces, of suspicions, and that silhouette that... No."

# game/scenario/11_0_1_1.rpy:745
translate english noam_garde_secret_71757f34:

    # "Ou peut-être que je continuerai juste à me mentir à moi-même."
    "Or maybe I'll just keep on lying to myself."

